<title>UK: Willis Corroon to sell unit to U.S. group.</title>
<headline>Willis Corroon to sell unit to U.S. group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance broker Willis Corroon Group Plc said on Thursday it had signed a definitive deal to sell the U.S. and UK operations of its WF Corroon unit to Buck Consultants Inc for a minimum of $20.25 million cash.</p>
</text>
